			- "The "
			dfn id=rules-for-parsing-a-list-of-dimensions "rules for parsing a list of dimensions"
			- " are as follows. These rules return a list of zero or more pairs consisting of a number and a unit, the unit being one of "
			i percentage
			- ", "
			i relative
			- ", and "
			i absolute
			- .
