			- ". Older APIs and HTML elements might have reason to use "
			a href="#encoding-parsing-a-url" id=resolving-urls:encoding-parsing-a-url "encoding-parse a URL"
			- ". When a custom base URL is needed or no base URL is desired, the "
			a data-x-internal=url-parser href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-parser" id=resolving-urls:url-parser "URL parser"
			- " can of course be used directly as well."
