			code id=the-link-element:the-link-element {
				a href="#the-link-element" link
			}
			- " element allows authors to link their document to other resources."
		}
		p {
			- "The address of the link(s) is given by the "
			dfn data-dfn-for=link data-dfn-type=element-attr id=attr-link-href {
				code href
			}
			- " attribute. If the "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-href-2 {
				a href="#attr-link-href" href
			}
			- " attribute is present, then its value must be a "
			a href="#valid-non-empty-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces" id=the-link-element:valid-non-empty-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces "valid non-empty URL potentially surrounded by spaces"
			- ". One or both of the "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-href-3 {
				a href="#attr-link-href" href
			}
			- " or "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-imagesrcset-2 {
				a href="#attr-link-imagesrcset" imagesrcset
			}
			- " attributes must be present."
		}
		p {
			- "If both the "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-href-4 {
				a href="#attr-link-href" href
			}
			- " and "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-imagesrcset-3 {
				a href="#attr-link-imagesrcset" imagesrcset
			}
			- " attributes are absent, then the element does not define a link."
		}
		p {
			- "The types of link indicated (the relationships) are given by the value of the "
			dfn data-dfn-for=link data-dfn-type=element-attr id=attr-link-rel {
				code rel
			}
			- " attribute, which, if present, must have a value that is a "
			a href="#unordered-set-of-unique-space-separated-tokens" id=the-link-element:unordered-set-of-unique-space-separated-tokens "unordered set of unique space-separated tokens"
			- ". The "
			a href="#linkTypes" "allowed keywords and their meanings"
			- " are defined in a later section. If the "
			code id=the-link-element:attr-link-rel-8 {
				a href="#attr-link-rel" rel
			}
