			code id=the-article-element:the-article-element-3 {
				a href="#the-article-element" article
			}
			- " elements represent articles that are in principle related to the contents of the outer article. For instance, a blog entry on a site that accepts user-submitted comments could represent the comments as "
			code id=the-article-element:the-article-element-4 {
				a href="#the-article-element" article
