			a data-x-internal='in' href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#in" id=images-processing-model:'in' "CSS inch"
			- ", and thus if the image data is 300x600, it has "
			a href="#density-corrected-intrinsic-width-and-height" id=images-processing-model:density-corrected-intrinsic-width-and-height-3 "density-corrected natural width and height"
			- " of 96 "
			a data-x-internal='px' href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px" id=images-processing-model:'px' "CSS pixels"
			- " by 192 "
			a data-x-internal='px' href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px" id=images-processing-model:'px'-2 "CSS pixels"
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "All "
			code id=images-processing-model:the-img-element-9 {
				a href="#the-img-element" img
			}
