				- "Notice the way that quotes have to be escaped (otherwise the "
				code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-srcdoc-4 {
					a href="#attr-iframe-srcdoc" srcdoc
				}
				- " attribute would end prematurely), and the way raw ampersands (e.g. in URLs or in prose) mentioned in the sandboxed content have to be "
				em doubly
				- " escaped — once so that the ampersand is preserved when originally parsing the "
				code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-srcdoc-5 {
					a href="#attr-iframe-srcdoc" srcdoc
				}
				- " attribute, and once more to prevent the ampersand from being misinterpreted when parsing the sandboxed content."
			}
			p {
				- "Furthermore, notice that since the "
				a href="#syntax-doctype" id=the-iframe-element:syntax-doctype-2 DOCTYPE
				- " is optional in "
