			}
		}
		p class=note {
			- "In "
			a href="#syntax" id=the-iframe-element:syntax-2 "the HTML syntax"
			- ", authors need only remember to use U+0022 QUOTATION MARK characters (\") to wrap the attribute contents and then to escape all U+0026 AMPERSAND (&) and U+0022 QUOTATION MARK (\") characters, and to specify the "
			code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-sandbox-3 {
				a href="#attr-iframe-sandbox" sandbox
			}
			- " attribute, to ensure safe embedding of content. (And remember to escape ampersands before quotation marks, to ensure quotation marks become &quot; and not &amp;quot;.)"
