			}
			- ", "
			code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-presentation-2 {
				a href="#attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-presentation" allow-presentation
			}
			- ", "
			code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-scripts-2 {
				a href="#attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-scripts" allow-scripts
			}
			- ", and "
			code id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox-2 {
				a href="#attr-iframe-sandbox-allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox" allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox
			}
			- " keywords re-enable forms, modal dialogs, screen orientation lock, the pointer lock API, popups, the presentation API, scripts, and the creation of unsandboxed "
			a href="#auxiliary-browsing-context" id=the-iframe-element:auxiliary-browsing-context "auxiliary browsing contexts"
			- " respectively. The "
