			a data-x-internal=url href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" id=the-video-element:url URL
			- " of an image file that the user agent can show while no video data is available. The attribute, if present, must contain a "
			a href="#valid-non-empty-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces" id=the-video-element:valid-non-empty-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces "valid non-empty URL potentially surrounded by spaces"
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "If the specified resource is to be used, then, when the element is created or when the "
			code id=the-video-element:attr-video-poster-2 {
