			- " in this section, since this section applies equally to "
			a href="#media-element" id=media-elements:media-element-3 "media elements"
			- " for audio or for video. The term "
			dfn id=media-resource "media resource"
			- " is used to refer to the complete set of media data, e.g. the complete video file, or complete audio file. "
		}
