			a href="#media-element" id=loading-the-media-resource:media-element-16 "media element"
			- " is as follows. This algorithm is always invoked as part of a "
			a href="#concept-task" id=loading-the-media-resource:concept-task-3 task
			- ", but one of the first steps in the algorithm is to return and continue running the remaining steps "
			a href="#in-parallel" id=loading-the-media-resource:in-parallel "in parallel"
			- ". In addition, this algorithm interacts closely with the "
			a href="#event-loop" id=loading-the-media-resource:event-loop "event loop"
			- " mechanism; in particular, it has "
			a href="#synchronous-section" id=loading-the-media-resource:synchronous-section "synchronous sections"
			- " (which are triggered as part of the "
			a href="#event-loop" id=loading-the-media-resource:event-loop-2 "event loop"
			- " algorithm). Steps in such sections are marked with ⌛."
