											a href="#is-currently-stalled" id=loading-the-media-resource:is-currently-stalled-3 "is currently stalled"
											- " to false."
										}
									}
								}
								p {
									- "While the user agent might still need network access to obtain parts of the "
									a href="#media-resource" id=loading-the-media-resource:media-resource-6 "media resource"
									- ", the user agent must remain on this step."
								}
								p class=example {
									- "For example, if the user agent has discarded the first half of a video, the user agent will remain at this step even once the "
									a href="#ended-playback" id=loading-the-media-resource:ended-playback "playback has ended"
									- ", because there is always the chance the user will seek back to the start. In fact, in this situation, once "
									a href="#ended-playback" id=loading-the-media-resource:ended-playback-2 "playback has ended"
									- ", the user agent will end up firing a "
									code id=loading-the-media-resource:event-media-suspend-3 {
										a href="#event-media-suspend" suspend
									}
									- " event, as described earlier."
