							a data-x-internal=content-type-sniffing:-video href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#rules-for-sniffing-audio-and-video-specifically" id=loading-the-media-resource:content-type-sniffing:-video-2 "rules for sniffing audio and video specifically"
