			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-67 "media element"
			- "'s "
			a href="#list-of-newly-introduced-cues" id=playing-the-media-resource:list-of-newly-introduced-cues-3 "list of newly introduced cues"
			- " has new cues added while the "
			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-68 "media element"
			- "'s "
			a href="#show-poster-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:show-poster-flag-3 "show poster flag"
			- " is not set, then the user agent must run the "
			i id=playing-the-media-resource:time-marches-on-2 {
				a href="#time-marches-on" "time marches on"
			}
			- " steps."
		}
		p {
			- "When a "
			a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-4 "text track cue"
			- " is removed from the "
			a href="#text-track-list-of-cues" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-list-of-cues-3 "list of cues"
			- " of a "
			a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-4 "text track"
			- " that is in the "
			a href="#list-of-text-tracks" id=playing-the-media-resource:list-of-text-tracks-3 "list of text tracks"
			- " for a "
			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-69 "media element"
			- ", and whenever a "
			a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-5 "text track"
			- " is removed from the "
			a href="#list-of-text-tracks" id=playing-the-media-resource:list-of-text-tracks-4 "list of text tracks"
			- " of a "
			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-70 "media element"
			- ", if the "
			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-71 "media element"
			- "'s "
			a href="#show-poster-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:show-poster-flag-4 "show poster flag"
			- " is not set, then the user agent must run the "
			i id=playing-the-media-resource:time-marches-on-3 {
				a href="#time-marches-on" "time marches on"
			}
			- " steps."
		}
		p {
			- "When the "
			a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-13 "current playback position"
			- " of a "
			a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-72 "media element"
			- " changes (e.g. due to playback or seeking), the user agent must run the "
			i id=playing-the-media-resource:time-marches-on-4 {
				a href="#time-marches-on" "time marches on"
			}
			- " steps. To support use cases that depend on the timing accuracy of cue event firing, such as synchronizing captions with shot changes in a video, user agents should fire cue events as close as possible to their position on the media timeline, and ideally within 20 milliseconds. If the "
			a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-14 "current playback position"
			- " changes while the steps are running, then the user agent must wait for the steps to complete, and then must immediately rerun the steps. These steps are thus run as often as possible or needed."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "If one iteration takes a long time, this can cause short duration "
			a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-5 cues
			- " to be skipped over as the user agent rushes ahead to \"catch up\", so these cues will not appear in the "
			code id=playing-the-media-resource:dom-texttrack-activecues {
				a href="#dom-texttrack-activecues" activeCues
			}
			- " list."
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id=time-marches-on {
				i "time marches on"
			}
			- " steps are as follows:"
		}
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var "current cues"
					- " be a list of "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-6 cues
					- ", initialized to contain all the "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-7 cues
					- " of all the "
					a href="#text-track-hidden" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-hidden hidden
					- " or "
					a href="#text-track-showing" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-showing showing
					a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-6 "text tracks"
					- " of the "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-73 "media element"
					- " (not the "
					a href="#text-track-disabled" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-disabled disabled
					- " ones) whose "
					a href="#text-track-cue-start-time" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-start-time-2 "start times"
					- " are less than or equal to the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-15 "current playback position"
					- " and whose "
					a href="#text-track-cue-end-time" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-end-time-2 "end times"
					- " are greater than the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-16 "current playback position"
					- .
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var "other cues"
					- " be a list of "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-8 cues
					- ", initialized to contain all the "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-9 cues
					- " of "
					a href="#text-track-hidden" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-hidden-2 hidden
					- " and "
					a href="#text-track-showing" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-showing-2 showing
					a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-7 "text tracks"
					- " of the "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-74 "media element"
					- " that are not present in "
					var "current cues"
					- .
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var "last time"
					- " be the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-17 "current playback position"
					- " at the time this algorithm was last run for this "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-75 "media element"
					- ", if this is not the first time it has run."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-18 "current playback position"
					- " has, since the last time this algorithm was run, only changed through its usual monotonic increase during normal playback, then let "
					var "missed cues"
					- " be the list of "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-10 cues
					- " in "
					var "other cues"
					- " whose "
					a href="#text-track-cue-start-time" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-start-time-3 "start times"
					- " are greater than or equal to "
					var "last time"
					- " and whose "
					a href="#text-track-cue-end-time" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-end-time-3 "end times"
					- " are less than or equal to the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-19 "current playback position"
					- ". Otherwise, let "
					var "missed cues"
					- " be an empty list."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Remove all the "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-11 cues
					- " in "
					var "missed cues"
					- " that are also in the "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-76 "media element"
					- "'s "
					a href="#list-of-newly-introduced-cues" id=playing-the-media-resource:list-of-newly-introduced-cues-4 "list of newly introduced cues"
					- ", and then empty the element's "
					a href="#list-of-newly-introduced-cues" id=playing-the-media-resource:list-of-newly-introduced-cues-5 "list of newly introduced cues"
					- .
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If the time was reached through the usual monotonic increase of the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-20 "current playback position"
					- " during normal playback, and if the user agent has not fired a "
					code id=playing-the-media-resource:event-media-timeupdate-6 {
						a href="#event-media-timeupdate" timeupdate
					}
					- " event at the element in the past 15 to 250ms and is not still running event handlers for such an event, then the user agent must "
					a href="#queue-a-media-element-task" id=playing-the-media-resource:queue-a-media-element-task-11 "queue a media element task"
					- " given the "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-77 "media element"
					- " to "
					a data-x-internal=concept-event-fire href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id=playing-the-media-resource:concept-event-fire-13 "fire an event"
					- " named "
					code id=playing-the-media-resource:event-media-timeupdate-7 {
						a href="#event-media-timeupdate" timeupdate
					}
					- " at the element. (In the other cases, such as explicit seeks, relevant events get fired as part of the overall process of changing the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-21 "current playback position"
					- ".)"
				}
				p class=note "The event thus is not to be fired faster than about 66Hz or slower than 4Hz (assuming the event handlers don't take longer than 250ms to run). User agents are encouraged to vary the frequency of the event based on the system load and the average cost of processing the event each time, so that the UI updates are not any more frequent than the user agent can comfortably handle while decoding the video."
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If all of the "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-12 cues
					- " in "
					var "current cues"
					- " have their "
					a href="#text-track-cue-active-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-active-flag "text track cue active flag"
					- " set, none of the "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-13 cues
					- " in "
					var "other cues"
					- " have their "
					a href="#text-track-cue-active-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-active-flag-2 "text track cue active flag"
					- " set, and "
					var "missed cues"
					- " is empty, then return."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If the time was reached through the usual monotonic increase of the "
					a href="#current-playback-position" id=playing-the-media-resource:current-playback-position-22 "current playback position"
					- " during normal playback, and there are "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-14 cues
					- " in "
					var "other cues"
					- " that have their "
					a href="#text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag "text track cue pause-on-exit flag"
					- " set and that either have their "
					a href="#text-track-cue-active-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-active-flag-3 "text track cue active flag"
					- " set or are also in "
					var "missed cues"
					- ", then "
					a href="#immediately" id=playing-the-media-resource:immediately immediately
					a href="#dom-media-pause" id=playing-the-media-resource:dom-media-pause pause
					- " the "
					a href="#media-element" id=playing-the-media-resource:media-element-78 "media element"
					- ". "
				}
				p class=note {
					- "In the other cases, such as explicit seeks, playback is not paused by going past the end time of a "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-15 cue
					- ", even if that "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-16 cue
					- " has its "
					a href="#text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag-2 "text track cue pause-on-exit flag"
					- " set."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var events
					- " be a list of "
					a href="#concept-task" id=playing-the-media-resource:concept-task tasks
					- ", initially empty. Each "
					a href="#concept-task" id=playing-the-media-resource:concept-task-2 task
					- " in this list will be associated with a "
					a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-8 "text track"
					- ", a "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-17 "text track cue"
					- ", and a time, which are used to sort the list before the "
					a href="#concept-task" id=playing-the-media-resource:concept-task-3 tasks
					- " are queued."
				}
				p {
					- "Let "
					var "affected tracks"
					- " be a list of "
					a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-9 "text tracks"
					- ", initially empty."
				}
				p {
					- "When the steps below say to "
					dfn id=prepare-an-event "prepare an event"
					- " named "
					var event
					- " for a "
					a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-18 "text track cue"
					var target
					- " with a time "
					var time
					- ", the user agent must run these steps:"
				}
				ol {
					li {
						p {
							- "Let "
							var track
							- " be the "
							a href="#text-track" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-10 "text track"
							- " with which the "
							a href="#text-track-cue" id=playing-the-media-resource:text-track-cue-19 "text track cue"
							var target
							- " is associated."
						}
					}
