		p {
			- "Having obtained the list of "
			code id=image-map-processing-model:the-area-element-2 {
				a href="#the-area-element" area
			}
			- " elements that form the image map (the "
			var areas
			- "), interactive user agents must process the list in one of two ways."
		}
		p {
			- "If the user agent intends to show the text that the "
			code id=image-map-processing-model:the-img-element-2 {
				a href="#the-img-element" img
			}
			- " element represents, then it must use the following steps."
		}
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Remove all the "
					code id=image-map-processing-model:the-area-element-3 {
						a href="#the-area-element" area
					}
					- " elements in "
					var areas
					- " that have no "
					code id=image-map-processing-model:attr-hyperlink-href {
						a href="#attr-hyperlink-href" href
