			}
			- " elements may be specified to give the dimensions of the visual content of the element (the width and height respectively, relative to the nominal direction of the output medium), in "
			a data-x-internal='px' href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px" id=dimension-attributes:'px' "CSS pixels"
