		p {
			- "A "
			dfn id=concept-table table
			- " consists of cells aligned on a two-dimensional grid of "
			dfn id=concept-slots slots
			- " with coordinates ("
			var x
			- ", "
			var y
			- "). The grid is finite, and is either empty or has one or more slots. If the grid has one or more slots, then the "
			var x
			- " coordinates are always in the range "
			span {
				- "0 ≤ "
				var x
				- " < "
				var {
					- x
					sub width
				}
			}
			- ", and the "
			var y
			- " coordinates are always in the range "
			span {
				- "0 ≤ "
				var y
				- " < "
				var {
					- y
					sub height
				}
			}
			- ". If one or both of "
			var {
				- x
				sub width
