			div class=feature {
				p {
					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/input/number" title="<input> elements of type number are used to let the user enter a number. They include built-in validation to reject non-numerical entries." "Element/input/number"
				}
				p class=all-engines-text "Support in all current engines."
				div class=support {
					span class="firefox yes" {
						span Firefox
