				}
				- " IDL attribute prefixes the filename with the string \""
				code "C:\\fakepath\\"
				- "\". Some legacy user agents actually included the full path (which was a security vulnerability). As a result of this, obtaining the filename from the "
				code id="file-upload-state-(type=file):dom-input-value-2" {
