		}
		div class=example {
			p "The following control allows any time in the day to be selected, with any accuracy (e.g. thousandth-of-a-second accuracy or more):"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" input
					c- e="" name
					c- o="" "="
