			a href="#hidden-state-(type=hidden)" id="common-input-element-events:hidden-state-(type=hidden)" Hidden
			- " state), the events are fired to indicate that the user has interacted with the control. The "
			code id=common-input-element-events:event-input-2 {
				a data-x-internal=event-input href="https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#event-type-input" input
			}
			- " event fires whenever the user has modified the data of the control. The "
