			a href="#attr-textarea-cols-value" id=the-textarea-element:attr-textarea-cols-value "character width"
			- " as a hint to the user as to how many characters the server prefers per line (e.g. for visual user agents by making the width of the control be that many characters). In visual renderings, the user agent should wrap the user's input in the rendering so that each line is no wider than this number of characters."
