					c- s="" "200"
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" textarea
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" p
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
			p "To give a default value, text can be included inside the element:"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" p
					c- p="" >
					- "If you have any comments, please let us know: "
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" textarea
					c- e="" cols
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "80"
					c- e="" name
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" comments
					c- p="" >
					- "You rock!"
					c- p="" "</"
					c- f="" textarea
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" p
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
			p "You can also give a minimum length. Here, a letter needs to be filled out by the user; a template (which is shorter than the minimum length) is provided, but is insufficient to submit the form:"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" textarea
					c- e="" required
					c- e="" minlength
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"500\""
					c- p="" >
					- "Dear Madam Speaker, Regarding your letter dated ... ... Yours Sincerely, ..."
					c- p="" "</"
					c- f="" textarea
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
			p "A placeholder can be given as well, to suggest the basic form to the user, without providing an explicit template:"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" textarea
					c- e="" placeholder
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"Dear Francine,"
					c- s="" "They closed the parks this week, so we won't be able to"
					c- s="" "meet your there. Should we just have dinner?"
					c- s="" Love,
					c- s="" "Daddy\""
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" textarea
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
			p {
				- "To have the browser submit "
				a href="#the-directionality" id=the-textarea-element:the-directionality-3 "the directionality"
				- " of the element along with the value, the "
				code id=the-textarea-element:attr-fe-dirname-4 {
					a href="#attr-fe-dirname" dirname
				}
				- " attribute can be specified:"
			}
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" p
					c- p="" >
					- "If you have any comments, please let us know (you may use either English or Hebrew for your comments): "
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" textarea
					c- e="" cols
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "80"
					c- e="" name
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" comments
					c- e="" dirname
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" comments.dir
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" textarea
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" p
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
		}
