		p {
			- "There are two attributes that determine the current task completion represented by the element. The "
			dfn data-dfn-for=progress data-dfn-type=element-attr id=attr-progress-value {
				code value
			}
			- " attribute specifies how much of the task has been completed, and the "
			dfn data-dfn-for=progress data-dfn-type=element-attr id=attr-progress-max {
				code max
			}
			- " attribute specifies how much work the task requires in total. The units are arbitrary and not specified."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "To make a determinate progress bar, add a "
			code id=the-progress-element:attr-progress-value-2 {
				a href="#attr-progress-value" value
			}
			- " attribute with the current progress (either a number from 0.0 to 1.0, or, if the "
			code id=the-progress-element:attr-progress-max-2 {
