			code id=the-progress-element:attr-progress-max-3 {
				a href="#attr-progress-max" max
			}
			- " attribute). To make an indeterminate progress bar, remove the "
			code id=the-progress-element:attr-progress-value-3 {
				a href="#attr-progress-value" value
			}
			- " attribute."
		}
		p "Authors are encouraged to also include the current value and the maximum value inline as text inside the element, so that the progress is made available to users of legacy user agents."
