			}
			ul {
				li {
					p {
						- "Hiding a dialog is different from closing one. Closing a dialog gives it a return value, fires an event, unblocks the page for other dialogs, and so on. Whereas hiding a dialog is a purely visual property, and is something you can already do with the "
						code id=the-dialog-element:attr-hidden-2 {
