		p {
			- "Objects that implement the "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " interface have attributes and methods (defined in this section) that control how lines are treated by the object."
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasPathDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=attribute id=dom-context-2d-linewidth {
				code lineWidth
			}
			- " attribute gives the width of lines, in coordinate space units. On getting, it must return the current value. On setting, zero, negative, infinite, and NaN values must be ignored, leaving the value unchanged; other values must change the current value to the new value."
		}
		p {
			- "When the object implementing the "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles-2 {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " interface is created, the "
			code id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-linewidth-2 {
				a href="#dom-context-2d-linewidth" lineWidth
			}
			- " attribute must initially have the value 1.0."
		}
		hr
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasPathDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=attribute id=dom-context-2d-linecap {
				code lineCap
			}
			- " attribute defines the type of endings that UAs will place on the end of lines. The three valid values are \""
			code butt
			- "\", \""
			code round
			- "\", and \""
			code square
			- "\"."
		}
		p "On getting, it must return the current value. On setting, the current value must be changed to the new value."
		p {
			- "When the object implementing the "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles-3 {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " interface is created, the "
			code id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-linecap-2 {
				a href="#dom-context-2d-linecap" lineCap
			}
			- " attribute must initially have the value \""
			code butt
			- "\"."
		}
		hr
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasPathDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=attribute id=dom-context-2d-linejoin {
				code lineJoin
			}
			- " attribute defines the type of corners that UAs will place where two lines meet. The three valid values are \""
			code bevel
			- "\", \""
			code round
			- "\", and \""
			code miter
			- "\"."
		}
		p "On getting, it must return the current value. On setting, the current value must be changed to the new value."
		p {
			- "When the object implementing the "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles-4 {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " interface is created, the "
			code id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-linejoin-2 {
				a href="#dom-context-2d-linejoin" lineJoin
			}
			- " attribute must initially have the value \""
			code miter
			- "\"."
		}
		hr
		p {
			- "When the "
			code id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-linejoin-3 {
				a href="#dom-context-2d-linejoin" lineJoin
			}
			- " attribute has the value \""
			code miter
			- "\", strokes use the miter limit ratio to decide how to render joins. The miter limit ratio can be explicitly set using the "
			dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasPathDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=attribute id=dom-context-2d-miterlimit {
				code miterLimit
			}
			- " attribute. On getting, it must return the current value. On setting, zero, negative, infinite, and NaN values must be ignored, leaving the value unchanged; other values must change the current value to the new value."
		}
		p {
			- "When the object implementing the "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles-5 {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " interface is created, the "
			code id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-miterlimit-2 {
				a href="#dom-context-2d-miterlimit" miterLimit
			}
			- " attribute must initially have the value 10.0."
		}
		hr
		p {
			- "Each "
			code id=line-styles:canvaspathdrawingstyles-6 {
				a href="#canvaspathdrawingstyles" CanvasPathDrawingStyles
			}
			- " object has a "
			dfn id=dash-list "dash list"
			- ", which is either empty or consists of an even number of non-negative numbers. Initially, the "
			a href="#dash-list" id=line-styles:dash-list "dash list"
			- " must be empty."
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasPathDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=method id=dom-context-2d-setlinedash {
				code {
					- "setLineDash("
					var segments
					- ")"
				}
			}
			- " method, when invoked, must run these steps:"
