			p {
				- "...the expression "
				code context.font
				- " would evaluate to the string \""
				code "italic 12px \"Unknown Font\", sans-serif"
				- "\". The \"400\" font-weight doesn't appear because that is the default value. The line-height doesn't appear because it is forced to \"normal\", the default value."
			}
		}
		p {
