					- " of the "
					a data-x-internal=first-available-font href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-fonts/#first-available-font" id=drawing-text-to-the-bitmap:first-available-font-2 "first available font"
					- ", in "
					a data-x-internal='px' href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#px" id=drawing-text-to-the-bitmap:'px'-8 "CSS pixels"
					- "; positive numbers indicating a distance going down from the given baseline."
