		p {
			- "Coordinates used in the value of the "
			a href="#concept-canvas-current-filter" id=filters:concept-canvas-current-filter-7 "current filter"
			- " are interpreted such that one pixel is equivalent to one SVG user space unit and to one canvas coordinate space unit. Filter coordinates are not affected by the "
			a href="#transformations" id=filters:transformations "current transformation matrix"
