			- " does not have any special meaning: it "
			a href="#represents" id=custom-elements-core-concepts:represents represents
			- " its children. A "
			a href="#customized-built-in-element" id=custom-elements-core-concepts:customized-built-in-element "customized built-in element"
			- " inherits the semantics of the element that it extends."
		}
		p {
			- "Any namespace-less attribute that is relevant to the element's functioning, as determined by the element's author, may be specified on an "
			a href="#autonomous-custom-element" id=custom-elements-core-concepts:autonomous-custom-element-3 "autonomous custom element"
