			a href="#xml-compatible" id=custom-elements-core-concepts:xml-compatible XML-compatible
			- " and contains no "
			a data-x-internal=uppercase-ascii-letters href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-upper-alpha" id=custom-elements-core-concepts:uppercase-ascii-letters "ASCII upper alphas"
			- ". The exception is the "
			code id=custom-elements-core-concepts:attr-is-3 {
				a href="#attr-is" is
