			- " at the top of its "
			a href="#custom-element-reactions-stack" id=custom-element-reactions:custom-element-reactions-stack "custom element reactions stack"
			- ". Each item in the stack is an "
			dfn id=element-queue "element queue"
			- ", which is initially empty as well. Each item in an "
			a href="#element-queue" id=custom-element-reactions:element-queue-2 "element queue"
