		hr
		p {
			- "To ensure "
			a href="#concept-custom-element-reaction" id=custom-element-reactions:concept-custom-element-reaction-4 "custom element reactions"
			- " are triggered appropriately, we introduce the "
			dfn data-dfn-type=extended-attribute data-lt=CEReactions id=cereactions {
				code "[CEReactions]"
			}
			- " IDL "
			a data-x-internal=extended-attribute href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-extended-attribute" id=custom-element-reactions:extended-attribute "extended attribute"
			- ". It indicates that the relevant algorithm is to be supplemented with additional steps in order to appropriately track and invoke "
			a href="#concept-custom-element-reaction" id=custom-element-reactions:concept-custom-element-reaction-5 "custom element reactions"
			- .
		}
