			- ". The same function when compared to other attributes must be compared according to its original case. In both cases, to match the values must be "
			a data-x-internal=identical-to href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-is" id="case-sensitivity-of-the-css-'attr()'-function:identical-to" "identical to"
