			- ". The same selector when compared to other elements must be compared according to its original case. In both cases, to match the values must be "
			a data-x-internal=identical-to href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-is" id=case-sensitivity-of-selectors:identical-to "identical to"
			- " each other (and therefore the comparison is case sensitive)."
