			}
			- " attribute whose "
			code id=items:attr-itemtype-6 {
				a href="#attr-itemtype" itemtype
			}
			- " attribute specifies a vocabulary that does not "
			a href="#support-global-identifiers-for-items" id=items:support-global-identifiers-for-items "support global identifiers for items"
			- ", as defined by that vocabulary's specification."
		}
		p {
			- "The exact meaning of a "
			a href="#global-identifier" id=items:global-identifier-2 "global identifier"
			- " is determined by the vocabulary's specification. It is up to such specifications to define whether multiple items with the same global identifier (whether on the same page or on different pages) are allowed to exist, and what the processing rules for that vocabulary are with respect to handling the case of multiple items with the same ID."
		}
