			p "The odd line wrapping is needed because newlines are meaningful in microdata: newlines would be preserved in a conversion to, for example, the vCard format."
		}
		div class=example {
			p {
				- "This example shows a site's contact details (using the "
				code id=examples-2:the-address-element {
					a href="#the-address-element" address
