		div class=example {
			p "The vCard vocabulary can be used to just mark up people's names:"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" span
					c- e="" itemscope
					c- e="" itemtype
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"http://microformats.org/profile/hcard\""
					c- p="" ><
					c- f="" span
					c- e="" itemprop
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" fn
					c- p="" ><
					c- f="" span
					c- e="" itemprop
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"n\""
					c- e="" itemscope
					c- p="" ><
					c- f="" span
					c- e="" itemprop
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"given-name\""
					c- p="" >
					- George
					c- p="" "</"
					c- f="" span
					c- p="" >
					c- p="" <
					c- f="" span
					c- e="" itemprop
					c- o="" "="
					c- s="" "\"family-name\""
					c- p="" >
					- Washington
					c- p="" "</"
					c- f="" span
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" span
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" span
					c- p="" "></"
					c- f="" span
					c- p="" >
				}
			}
			p "This creates a single item with a two name-value pairs, one with the name \"fn\" and the value \"George Washington\", and the other with the name \"n\" and a second item as its value, the second item having the two name-value pairs \"given-name\" and \"family-name\" with the values \"George\" and \"Washington\" respectively. This is defined to map to the following vCard:"
			pre {
				- "BEGIN:VCARD PROFILE:VCARD VERSION:4.0 SOURCE:"
				var "document's address"
				- " FN:George Washington N:Washington;George;;; END:VCARD"
			}
		}
		h4 id=vevent {
			span class=secno "5.3.2"
			- " vEvent"
			a class=self-link href="#vevent"
		}
		p {
			- "An item with the "
			a href="#item-types" id=vevent:item-types "item type"
			dfn id=md-vevent {
				code "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
			}
			- " represents an event."
		}
		p {
			- "This vocabulary does not "
			a href="#support-global-identifiers-for-items" id=vevent:support-global-identifiers-for-items "support global identifiers for items"
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "The following are the type's "
			a href="#defined-property-name" id=vevent:defined-property-name "defined property names"
			- ". They are based on the vocabulary defined in "
			cite "Internet Calendaring and Scheduling Core Object Specification"
			- " ("
			cite iCalendar
			- "), where more information on how to interpret the values can be found. "
			a href="#refsRFC5545" "[RFC5545]"
		}
		p class=note "Only the parts of the iCalendar vocabulary relating to events are used here; this vocabulary cannot express a complete iCalendar instance."
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-attach {
					code attach
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives the address of an associated document for the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value value
					- " must be an "
					a data-x-internal=absolute-url href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#syntax-url-absolute" id=vevent:absolute-url "absolute URL"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "Any number of properties with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-attach {
						a href="#md-vevent-attach" attach
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-categories {
					code categories
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives the name of a category or tag that the event could be classified as."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-2 value
					- " must be text."
				}
				p {
					- "Any number of properties with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-categories {
						a href="#md-vevent-categories" categories
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-2 item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-2 {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-class {
					code class
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives the access classification of the information regarding the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-3 value
					- " must be text with one of the following values:"
				}
				ul class=brief {
					li {
						code public
					}
					li {
						code private
					}
					li {
						code confidential
					}
				}
				p class=warning "This is merely advisory and cannot be considered a confidentiality measure."
				p {
					- "A single property with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-class {
						a href="#md-vevent-class" class
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-3 item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-3 {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-comment {
					code comment
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives a comment regarding the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-4 value
					- " must be text."
				}
				p {
					- "Any number of properties with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-comment {
						a href="#md-vevent-comment" comment
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-4 item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-4 {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-description {
					code description
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives a detailed description of the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-5 value
					- " must be text."
				}
				p {
					- "A single property with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-description {
						a href="#md-vevent-description" description
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-5 item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-5 {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-geo {
					code geo
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives the geographical position of the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-6 value
					- " must be text and must match the following syntax:"
				}
				ol {
					li "Optionally, either a U+002B PLUS SIGN character (+) or a U+002D HYPHEN-MINUS character (-)."
					li {
						- "One or more "
						a data-x-internal=ascii-digits href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-digit" id=vevent:ascii-digits "ASCII digits"
						- .
					}
					li {
						- "Optionally*, a U+002E FULL STOP character (.) followed by one or more "
						a data-x-internal=ascii-digits href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-digit" id=vevent:ascii-digits-2 "ASCII digits"
						- .
					}
					li "A U+003B SEMICOLON character (;)."
					li "Optionally, either a U+002B PLUS SIGN character (+) or a U+002D HYPHEN-MINUS character (-)."
					li {
						- "One or more "
						a data-x-internal=ascii-digits href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-digit" id=vevent:ascii-digits-3 "ASCII digits"
						- .
					}
					li {
						- "Optionally*, a U+002E FULL STOP character (.) followed by one or more "
						a data-x-internal=ascii-digits href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-digit" id=vevent:ascii-digits-4 "ASCII digits"
						- .
					}
				}
				p "The optional components marked with an asterisk (*) should be included, and should have six digits each."
				p class=note "The value specifies latitude and longitude, in that order (i.e., \"LAT LON\" ordering), in decimal degrees. The longitude represents the location east and west of the prime meridian as a positive or negative real number, respectively. The latitude represents the location north and south of the equator as a positive or negative real number, respectively."
				p {
					- "A single property with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-geo {
						a href="#md-vevent-geo" geo
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-6 item
					- " with the type "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-6 {
						a href="#md-vevent" "http://microformats.org/profile/hcalendar#vevent"
					}
					- .
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id=md-vevent-location {
					code location
				}
			}
			dd {
				p "Gives the location of the event."
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id=vevent:concept-property-value-7 value
					- " must be text."
				}
				p {
					- "A single property with the name "
					code id=vevent:md-vevent-location {
						a href="#md-vevent-location" location
					}
					- " may be present within each "
					a href="#concept-item" id=vevent:concept-item-7 item
