		h4 id=coep {
			span class=secno "7.1.4"
			- " Cross-origin embedder policies"
			a class=self-link href="#coep"
		}
		div class="mdn-anno wrapped" {
			button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick="toggleStatus(this)" {
				b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines." ✔
				span MDN
			}
			div class=feature {
				p {
					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy" title="The HTTP Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP) response header configures embedding cross-origin resources into the document." "Headers/Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"
				}
				p class=all-engines-text "Support in all current engines."
				div class=support {
					span class="firefox yes" {
						span Firefox
						span "79+"
					}
					span class="safari yes" {
						span Safari
						span "15.2+"
					}
					span class="chrome yes" {
						span Chrome
						span "83+"
					}
					hr
					span class="opera unknown" {
						span Opera
						span ?
					}
					span class="edge_blink yes" {
						span Edge
						span "83+"
					}
					hr
					span class="edge unknown" {
						span "Edge (Legacy)"
						span ?
					}
					span class="ie no" {
						span "Internet Explorer"
						span No
					}
					hr
					span class="firefox_android unknown" {
						span "Firefox Android"
						span ?
					}
					span class="safari_ios unknown" {
						span "Safari iOS"
						span ?
					}
					span class="chrome_android unknown" {
						span "Chrome Android"
						span ?
					}
					span class="webview_android yes" {
						span "WebView Android"
						span "86+"
					}
					span class="samsunginternet_android unknown" {
						span "Samsung Internet"
						span ?
					}
					span class="opera_android unknown" {
						span "Opera Android"
						span ?
					}
				}
			}
		}
		p {
			- "An "
			dfn data-export="" id=embedder-policy-value "embedder policy value"
			- " is one of three strings that controls the fetching of cross-origin resources without explicit permission from resource owners."
		}
		dl {
			dt {
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy value" data-export="" id=coep-unsafe-none {
					code unsafe-none
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				p {
					- "This is the default value. When this value is used, cross-origin resources can be fetched without giving explicit permission through the "
					a data-x-internal=cors-protocol href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol" id=coep:cors-protocol "CORS protocol"
					- " or the `"
					code id=coep:cross-origin-resource-policy {
						a data-x-internal=cross-origin-resource-policy href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cross-origin-resource-policy" Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy
					}
					- "` header."
				}
			}
			dt {
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy value" data-export="" id=coep-require-corp {
					code require-corp
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				p {
					- "When this value is used, fetching cross-origin resources requires the server's explicit permission through the "
					a data-x-internal=cors-protocol href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol" id=coep:cors-protocol-2 "CORS protocol"
					- " or the `"
					code id=coep:cross-origin-resource-policy-2 {
						a data-x-internal=cross-origin-resource-policy href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cross-origin-resource-policy" Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy
					}
					- "` header."
				}
			}
			dt {
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy value" data-export="" id=coep-credentialless {
					code credentialless
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				p {
					- "When this value is used, fetching cross-origin no-CORS resources omits credentials. In exchange, an explicit `"
					code id=coep:cross-origin-resource-policy-3 {
						a data-x-internal=cross-origin-resource-policy href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cross-origin-resource-policy" Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy
					}
					- "` header is not required. Other requests sent with credentials require the server's explicit permission through the "
					a data-x-internal=cors-protocol href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol" id=coep:cors-protocol-3 "CORS protocol"
					- " or the `"
					code id=coep:cross-origin-resource-policy-4 {
						a data-x-internal=cross-origin-resource-policy href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cross-origin-resource-policy" Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy
					}
					- "` header."
				}
			}
		}
		div class=warning {
			p {
				- "Before supporting \""
				code id=coep:coep-credentialless {
					a href="#coep-credentialless" credentialless
				}
				- "\", implementers are strongly encouraged to support both: "
			}
			ul class=brief {
				li {
					a href="https://wicg.github.io/private-network-access/" "Private Network Access"
				}
				li {
					a href="https://github.com/annevk/orb" "Opaque Response Blocking"
				}
			}
			p {
				- "Otherwise, it would allow attackers to leverage the client's network position to read non public resources, using the "
				a href="#concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability" id=coep:concept-settings-object-cross-origin-isolated-capability "cross-origin isolated capability"
				- .
			}
		}
		p {
			- "An "
			a href="#embedder-policy-value" id=coep:embedder-policy-value "embedder policy value"
			- " is "
			dfn id=compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation "compatible with cross-origin isolation"
			- " if it is \""
			code id=coep:coep-credentialless-2 {
				a href="#coep-credentialless" credentialless
			}
			- "\" or \""
			code id=coep:coep-require-corp {
				a href="#coep-require-corp" require-corp
			}
			- "\"."
		}
		p {
			- "An "
			dfn data-export="" id=embedder-policy "embedder policy"
			- " consists of:"
		}
		ul {
			li {
				p {
					- "A "
					dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy" data-export="" id=embedder-policy-value-2 value
					- ", which is an "
					a href="#embedder-policy-value" id=coep:embedder-policy-value-2 "embedder policy value"
					- ", initially \""
					code id=coep:coep-unsafe-none {
						a href="#coep-unsafe-none" unsafe-none
					}
					- "\"."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "A "
					dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy" data-export="" id=embedder-policy-reporting-endpoint "reporting endpoint"
					- " string, initially the empty string."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "A "
					dfn data-dfn-for="embedder policy" data-export="" id=embedder-policy-report-only-value "report only value"
					- ", which is an "
					a href="#embedder-policy-value" id=coep:embedder-policy-value-3 "embedder policy value"
