		div class=example {
			p "Consider a game where the user can navigate along a line, such that the user is always at some coordinate, and such that the user can bookmark the page corresponding to a particular coordinate, to return to it later."
			p "A static page implementing the x=5 position in such a game could look like the following:"
			pre {
				code class=html {
					c- cp="" "<!DOCTYPE HTML>"
