		h4 id=navigation-api {
			span class=secno "7.2.6"
			- " The navigation API"
			a class=self-link href="#navigation-api"
		}
		h5 id=navigation-api-intro {
			span class=secno "7.2.6.1"
			- " Introduction"
			a class=self-link href="#navigation-api-intro"
		}
		p {
			i "This section is non-normative."
		}
		p {
			- "The navigation API, provided by the global "
			code id=navigation-api-intro:dom-navigation {
				a href="#dom-navigation" navigation
			}
			- " property, provides a modern and web application-focused way of managing navigations and history entries. It is a successor to the classic "
			code id=navigation-api-intro:dom-location {
				a href="#dom-location" location
			}
			- " and "
			code id=navigation-api-intro:dom-history {
				a href="#dom-history" history
			}
			- " APIs."
		}
		p {
			- "One ability the API provides is inspecting "
			a href="#session-history-entry" id=navigation-api-intro:session-history-entry "session history entries"
			- ". For example, the following will display the entries' URLs in an ordered list:"
		}
		pre {
