					li {
						p {
							- "For cross-document navigations, or navigations that result in 204 or 205 "
							a data-x-internal=concept-response-status href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-status" id=navigation-api-initiating-navigations:concept-response-status statuses
							- " or `"
							code id=navigation-api-initiating-navigations:http-content-disposition {
								a data-x-internal=http-content-disposition href="https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc6266.html" "Content-Disposition: attachment"
							}
							- "` header fields from the server (and thus do not actually navigate), both promises will never settle."
						}
