						- "'s "
						a href="#nav-document" id=beginning-navigation:nav-document-2 "active document"
						- ", which are in theory only accessible over in the appropriate "
						a href="#event-loop" id=beginning-navigation:event-loop "event loop"
						- ". (But, we do not want to unconditionally queue a task, since — for example — same-event-loop "
