			a href="#navigable" id=updating-the-traversable:navigable navigable
			- " descendants of the traversable, "
			a href="#populating-a-session-history-entry" populating
			- " them in parallel, and then synchronizing back up to ensure everyone has the same view of the result. This is further complicated by the existence of synchronous same-document navigations being mixed together with cross-document navigations, and how web pages have come to have certain relative timing expectations."
