			- " or "
			a href="#environment-settings-object" id=realms-settings-objects-global-objects:environment-settings-object-5 "environment settings object"
			- " is to be used. In general, there are at least four possibilities:"
		}
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id=concept-entry-everything Entry
			}
			dd "This corresponds to the script that initiated the currently running script action: i.e., the function or script that the user agent called into when it called into author code."
			dt {
				dfn id=concept-incumbent-everything Incumbent
			}
			dd "This corresponds to the most-recently-entered author function or script on the stack, or the author function or script that originally scheduled the currently-running callback."
