				- " has a "
				a href="#concept-relevant-realm" id=realms-settings-objects-global-objects:concept-relevant-realm "relevant realm"
				- ", which is roughly the "
				a data-x-internal=realm href="https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-code-realms" id=realms-settings-objects-global-objects:realm-8 realm
