			- .
		}
		p {
			- "In general, web platform specifications should use the "
			a href="#concept-relevant-everything" id=realms-settings-objects-global-objects:concept-relevant-everything-2 relevant
			- " concept, applied to the object being operated on (usually the "
			b this
