		div class=example id=example-import-map-merge-unrelated {
			p "There are two cases when rules of the new import map don't get merged into the existing one."
			ol {
				li {
					p "The new import map rule has the exact same scope and specifier as a rule in the existing import map. We'll call that \"conflicting rule\"."
				}
				li {
					p "The new import map rule may impact the resolution of an already resolved module. We'll call that \"impacted already resolved module\"."
				}
			}
			p "When the new import map has no conflicting rules, and there are no impacted resolved modules, the resulting map would be a combination of the new and existing maps. Rules that would have individually impacted similar modules (e.g. \"/app/\" and \"/app/helper\") but are not an exact match are not conflicting, and all make it to the merged map."
			p "So, the following existing and new import maps:"
			pre {
				code class=json {
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"imports\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/app/\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./original-app/\""
					c- p="" ,
					c- p="" "}"
					c- p="" "}"
				}
				code class=json {
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"imports\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/app/helper\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./helper/index.mjs\""
					c- p="" "},"
					c- u="" "\"scopes\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/js\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/app/\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./js-app/\""
					c- p="" "}"
					c- p="" "}"
					c- p="" "}"
				}
			}
			p "Would be equivalent to the following single import map:"
			pre {
				code class=json {
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"imports\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/app/\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./original-app/\""
					c- p="" ,
					c- u="" "\"/app/helper\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./helper/index.mjs\""
					c- p="" "},"
					c- u="" "\"scopes\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/js\""
					c- o="" :
					c- p="" "{"
					c- u="" "\"/app/\""
					c- o="" :
					c- u="" "\"./js-app/\""
					c- p="" "}"
					c- p="" "}"
					c- p="" "}"
				}
			}
		}
		div class=example id=example-import-map-merge-conflict-imports {
