				div class=example {
					p {
						- "If the user had visited a site at "
						code "https://example.com/"
						- " that made the following call:"
					}
					pre {
						code class=js {
							- navigator
							c- p="" .
							- registerProtocolHandler
							c- p="" "("
							c- t="" 'web+soup'
							c- p="" ,
							c- t="" "'soup?url=%s'"
							c- p="" ")"
						}
					}
					p {
						- "...and then, much later, while visiting "
						code "https://www.example.net/"
						- ", clicked on a link such as:"
					}
					pre {
						code class=html {
							c- p="" <
							c- f="" a
							c- e="" href
							c- o="" "="
							c- s="" "\"web+soup:chicken-kïwi\""
							c- p="" >
							- "Download our Chicken Kïwi soup!"
							c- p="" "</"
							c- f="" a
							c- p="" >
						}
					}
					p "...then the UA might navigate to the following URL:"
					pre "https://example.com/soup?url=web+soup:chicken-k%C3%AFwi"
					p "This site could then do whatever it is that it does with soup (synthesize it and ship it to the user, or whatever)."
				}
				p {
