			- " list."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "These names were chosen based on evidence of what websites historically search for, and thus what is necessary for user agents to expose in order to maintain compatibility with existing content. They are ordered alphabetically. The \""
			code "PDF Viewer"
			- "\" name was then inserted in the 0th position so that the "
			code id=pdf-viewing-support:dom-mimetype-enabledplugin-2 {
				a href="#dom-mimetype-enabledplugin" enabledPlugin
			}
			- " getter could point to a generic plugin name."
