					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API" title="Web Workers makes it possible to run a script operation in a background thread separate from the main execution thread of a web application. The advantage of this is that laborious processing can be performed in a separate thread, allowing the main (usually the UI) thread to run without being blocked/slowed down." Web_Workers_API
				}
				p class=all-engines-text "Support in all current engines."
				div class=support {
					span class="firefox yes" {
