		p {
			i "This section is non-normative."
		}
		p "This section introduces shared workers using a Hello World example. Shared workers use slightly different APIs, since each worker can have multiple connections."
		p "This first example shows how you connect to a worker and how a worker can send a message back to the page when it connects to it. Received messages are displayed in a log."
		p "Here is the HTML page:"
		pre {
			code class=html {
				c- cp="" "<!DOCTYPE HTML>"
				c- p="" <
