		p {
			strong "Connecting to multiple pages"
			- ". The script uses the "
			code id=shared-state-using-a-shared-worker:handler-sharedworkerglobalscope-onconnect {
				a href="#handler-sharedworkerglobalscope-onconnect" onconnect
			}
			- " event listener to listen for multiple connections."
		}
		p {
			strong "Direct channels"
			- ". When the worker receives a \"msg\" message from one viewer naming another viewer, it sets up a direct connection between the two, so that the two viewers can communicate directly without the worker having to proxy all the messages."
		}
		p {
			a href="/demos/workers/multiviewer/page.html" "View this example online"
			- .
		}
		h5 id=delegation {
			span class=secno "10.1.2.5"
			- " Delegation"
			a class=self-link href="#delegation"
		}
		p {
			i "This section is non-normative."
		}
		p "With multicore CPUs becoming prevalent, one way to obtain better performance is to split computationally expensive tasks amongst multiple workers. In this example, a computationally expensive task that is to be performed for every number from 1 to 10,000,000 is farmed out to ten subworkers."
		p "The main page is as follows, it just reports the result:"
		pre {
			code class=html {
				c- cp="" "<!DOCTYPE HTML>"
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" html
				c- e="" lang
				c- o="" "="
				c- s="" "\"en\""
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" head
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" meta
				c- e="" charset
				c- o="" "="
				c- s="" "\"utf-8\""
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" title
				c- p="" >
				- "Worker example: Multicore computation"
				c- p="" "</"
				c- f="" title
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" "</"
				c- f="" head
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" body
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" p
				c- p="" >
				- "Result: "
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" output
				c- e="" id
				c- o="" "="
				c- s="" "\"result\""
				c- p="" "></"
				c- f="" output
				c- p="" "></"
				c- f="" p
				c- p="" >
				c- p="" <
				c- f="" script
				c- p="" >
				c- a="" var
				- " worker "
				c- o="" "="
				c- k="" new
				- " Worker"
				c- p="" "("
				c- t="" 'worker.js'
				c- p="" ");"
				- " worker"
				c- p="" .
				- "onmessage "
				c- o="" "="
				c- a="" function
				c- p="" "("
				- event
				c- p="" ")"
				c- p="" "{"
				- " document"
				c- p="" .
				- getElementById
				c- p="" "("
				c- t="" 'result'
				c- p="" ")."
				- "textContent "
				c- o="" "="
				- " event"
				c- p="" .
				- data
				c- p="" ";"
				c- p="" "};"
				c- p="" "</"
				c- f="" script
				c- p="" >
