				p {
					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WorkerGlobalScope" title="The WorkerGlobalScope interface of the Web Workers API is an interface representing the scope of any worker. Workers have no browsing context; this scope contains the information usually conveyed by Window objects — in this case event handlers, the console or the associated WorkerNavigator object. Each WorkerGlobalScope has its own event loop." WorkerGlobalScope
				}
