		p {
			- "No other namespaced attribute can be expressed in "
			a href="#syntax" id=attributes-2:syntax "the HTML syntax"
			- .
		}
		p class=note {
			- "Whether the attributes in the table above are conforming or not is defined by other specifications (e.g. "
			cite "SVG 2"
			- " and "
			cite MathML
