		}
		p class=note {
			- "Omitting an element's "
			a href="#syntax-start-tag" id=optional-tags:syntax-start-tag "start tag"
			- " in the situations described below does not mean the element is not present; it is implied, but it is still there. For example, an HTML document always has a root "
			code id=optional-tags:the-html-element {
