		h5 id=the-stack-of-open-elements {
			span class=secno "13.2.4.2"
			- " The stack of open elements"
			a class=self-link href="#the-stack-of-open-elements"
		}
		p {
			- "Initially, the "
			dfn id=stack-of-open-elements "stack of open elements"
			- " is empty. The stack grows downwards; the topmost node on the stack is the first one added to the stack, and the bottommost node of the stack is the most recently added node in the stack (notwithstanding when the stack is manipulated in a random access fashion as part of "
			a href="#adoptionAgency" "the handling for misnested tags"
			- ")."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "The \""
			a href="#the-before-html-insertion-mode" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:the-before-html-insertion-mode "before html"
			- "\" "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:insertion-mode "insertion mode"
			- " creates the "
			code id=the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element {
				a href="#the-html-element" html
			}
			a data-x-internal=document-element href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-element" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:document-element "document element"
			- ", which is then added to the stack."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "In the "
			a href="#fragment-case" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:fragment-case "fragment case"
			- ", the "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:stack-of-open-elements "stack of open elements"
			- " is initialized to contain an "
			code id=the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element-2 {
				a href="#the-html-element" html
			}
			- " element that is created as part of "
			a href="#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:html-fragment-parsing-algorithm "that algorithm"
			- ". (The "
			a href="#fragment-case" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:fragment-case-2 "fragment case"
			- " skips the \""
			a href="#the-before-html-insertion-mode" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:the-before-html-insertion-mode-2 "before html"
			- "\" "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:insertion-mode-2 "insertion mode"
			- ".)"
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			code id=the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element-3 {
				a href="#the-html-element" html
			}
			- " node, however it is created, is the topmost node of the stack. It only gets popped off the stack when the parser "
			a href="#stop-parsing" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:stop-parsing finishes
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id=current-node "current node"
			- " is the bottommost node in this "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:stack-of-open-elements-2 "stack of open elements"
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id=adjusted-current-node "adjusted current node"
			- " is the "
			i id=the-stack-of-open-elements:concept-frag-parse-context {
				a href="#concept-frag-parse-context" context
			}
			- " element if the parser was created as part of the "
			a href="#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:html-fragment-parsing-algorithm-2 "HTML fragment parsing algorithm"
			- " and the "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=the-stack-of-open-elements:stack-of-open-elements-3 "stack of open elements"
			- " has only one element in it ("
