			dt "A character token that is one of U+0009 CHARACTER TABULATION, U+000A LINE FEED (LF), U+000C FORM FEED (FF), U+000D CARRIAGE RETURN (CR), or U+0020 SPACE"
			dt "A comment token"
			dt "A start tag whose tag name is one of: \"basefont\", \"bgsound\", \"link\", \"meta\", \"noframes\", \"style\""
			dd {
				p {
