							- "Set the "
							a href="#parser-pause-flag" id=parsing-main-incdata:parser-pause-flag-2 "parser pause flag"
							- " to true, and abort the processing of any nested invocations of the tokenizer, yielding control back to the caller. (Tokenization will resume when the caller returns to the \"outer\" tree construction stage.)"
						}
						p class=note {
							- "The tree construction stage of this particular parser is "
							a href="#nestedParsing" "being called reentrantly"
