								}
								p class=note {
									- "This could happen if, e.g., while the "
									a href="#spin-the-event-loop" id=parsing-main-incdata:spin-the-event-loop-2 "spin the event loop"
									- " algorithm is running, the "
									code id=parsing-main-incdata:document-3 {
										a href="#document" Document
									}
									- " gets "
									a href="#destroy-a-document" id=parsing-main-incdata:destroy-a-document destroyed
									- ", or the "
									code id=parsing-main-incdata:dom-document-open {
										a href="#dom-document-open" "document.open()"
									}
									- " method gets invoked on the "
									code id=parsing-main-incdata:document-4 {
										a href="#document" Document
									}
									- .
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									a href="#stop-the-speculative-html-parser" id=parsing-main-incdata:stop-the-speculative-html-parser "Stop the speculative HTML parser"
									- " for this instance of the HTML parser."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Unblock the "
									a href="#tokenization" id=parsing-main-incdata:tokenization-3 tokenizer
									- " for this instance of the "
									a href="#html-parser" id=parsing-main-incdata:html-parser-2 "HTML parser"
									- ", such that "
									a href="#concept-task" id=parsing-main-incdata:concept-task-2 tasks
									- " that invoke the "
									a href="#tokenization" id=parsing-main-incdata:tokenization-4 tokenizer
									- " can again be run."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Let the "
									a href="#insertion-point" id=parsing-main-incdata:insertion-point-5 "insertion point"
									- " be just before the "
									a href="#next-input-character" id=parsing-main-incdata:next-input-character-2 "next input character"
									- .
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Increment the parser's "
									a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-incdata:script-nesting-level-5 "script nesting level"
									- " by one (it should be zero before this step, so this sets it to one)."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									a href="#execute-the-script-element" id=parsing-main-incdata:execute-the-script-element "Execute the script element"
									var "the script"
									- .
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Decrement the parser's "
									a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-incdata:script-nesting-level-6 "script nesting level"
									- " by one. If the parser's "
									a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-incdata:script-nesting-level-7 "script nesting level"
									- " is zero (which it always should be at this point), then set the "
									a href="#parser-pause-flag" id=parsing-main-incdata:parser-pause-flag-3 "parser pause flag"
									- " to false."
								}
							}
							li {
