					a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-after-after-body-insertion-mode:insertion-mode-3 "insertion mode"
					- " to \""
					a href="#parsing-main-inbody" id=the-after-after-body-insertion-mode:parsing-main-inbody-2 "in body"
					- "\" and reprocess the token."
				}
			}
		}
		h6 id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode {
			span class=secno "13.2.6.4.23"
			- " The \""
			dfn "after after frameset"
			- "\" insertion mode"
			a class=self-link href="#the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode"
		}
		p {
			- "When the user agent is to apply the rules for the \""
			a href="#the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode "after after frameset"
			- "\" "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:insertion-mode "insertion mode"
			- ", the user agent must handle the token as follows:"
		}
		dl class=switch {
			dt "A comment token"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-comment" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:insert-a-comment "Insert a comment"
					- " as the last child of the "
					code id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:document {
						a href="#document" Document
					}
					- " object."
				}
			}
			dt "A DOCTYPE token"
			dt "A character token that is one of U+0009 CHARACTER TABULATION, U+000A LINE FEED (LF), U+000C FORM FEED (FF), U+000D CARRIAGE RETURN (CR), or U+0020 SPACE"
			dt "A start tag whose tag name is \"html\""
			dd {
				p {
					- "Process the token "
					a href="#using-the-rules-for" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:using-the-rules-for "using the rules for"
					- " the \""
					a href="#parsing-main-inbody" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:parsing-main-inbody "in body"
					- "\" "
					a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:insertion-mode-2 "insertion mode"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "An end-of-file token"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#stop-parsing" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:stop-parsing "Stop parsing"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "A start tag whose tag name is \"noframes\""
			dd {
				p {
					- "Process the token "
					a href="#using-the-rules-for" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:using-the-rules-for-2 "using the rules for"
					- " the \""
					a href="#parsing-main-inhead" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:parsing-main-inhead "in head"
					- "\" "
					a href="#insertion-mode" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:insertion-mode-3 "insertion mode"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "Anything else"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#parse-errors" id=the-after-after-frameset-insertion-mode:parse-errors "Parse error"
					- ". Ignore the token."
				}
			}
		}
		h5 id=parsing-main-inforeign {
			span class=secno "13.2.6.5"
			- " The rules for parsing tokens "
			dfn "in foreign content"
			a class=self-link href="#parsing-main-inforeign"
		}
		p "When the user agent is to apply the rules for parsing tokens in foreign content, the user agent must handle the token as follows:"
		dl class=switch {
			dt "A character token that is U+0000 NULL"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#parse-errors" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parse-errors "Parse error"
					- ". "
					a href="#insert-a-character" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insert-a-character "Insert a U+FFFD REPLACEMENT CHARACTER character"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "A character token that is one of U+0009 CHARACTER TABULATION, U+000A LINE FEED (LF), U+000C FORM FEED (FF), U+000D CARRIAGE RETURN (CR), or U+0020 SPACE"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-character" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insert-a-character-2 "Insert the token's character"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "Any other character token"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-character" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insert-a-character-3 "Insert the token's character"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "Set the "
					a href="#frameset-ok-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:frameset-ok-flag "frameset-ok flag"
					- " to \"not ok\"."
				}
			}
			dt "A comment token"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-comment" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insert-a-comment "Insert a comment"
					- .
				}
			}
			dt "A DOCTYPE token"
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#parse-errors" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parse-errors-2 "Parse error"
					- ". Ignore the token."
				}
			}
			dt "A start tag whose tag name is one of: \"b\", \"big\", \"blockquote\", \"body\", \"br\", \"center\", \"code\", \"dd\", \"div\", \"dl\", \"dt\", \"em\", \"embed\", \"h1\", \"h2\", \"h3\", \"h4\", \"h5\", \"h6\", \"head\", \"hr\", \"i\", \"img\", \"li\", \"listing\", \"menu\", \"meta\", \"nobr\", \"ol\", \"p\", \"pre\", \"ruby\", \"s\", \"small\", \"span\", \"strong\", \"strike\", \"sub\", \"sup\", \"table\", \"tt\", \"u\", \"ul\", \"var\""
			dt "A start tag whose tag name is \"font\", if the token has any attributes named \"color\", \"face\", or \"size\""
			dt "An end tag whose tag name is \"br\", \"p\""
			dd {
				p {
					a href="#parse-errors" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parse-errors-3 "Parse error"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "While the "
					a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node "current node"
					- " is not a "
					a href="#mathml-text-integration-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:mathml-text-integration-point "MathML text integration point"
					- ", an "
					a href="#html-integration-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:html-integration-point "HTML integration point"
					- ", or an element in the "
					a data-x-internal=html-namespace-2 href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:html-namespace-2 "HTML namespace"
					- ", pop elements from the "
					a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements "stack of open elements"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "Reprocess the token according to the rules given in the section corresponding to the current "
					a href="#insertion-mode" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-mode "insertion mode"
					- " in HTML content."
				}
			}
			dt "Any other start tag"
			dd {
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#adjusted-current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjusted-current-node "adjusted current node"
					- " is an element in the "
					a data-x-internal=mathml-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#mathml-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:mathml-namespace "MathML namespace"
					- ", "
					a href="#adjust-mathml-attributes" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjust-mathml-attributes "adjust MathML attributes"
					- " for the token. (This fixes the case of MathML attributes that are not all lowercase.)"
				}
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#adjusted-current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjusted-current-node-2 "adjusted current node"
					- " is an element in the "
					a data-x-internal=svg-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#svg-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:svg-namespace "SVG namespace"
					- ", and the token's tag name is one of the ones in the first column of the following table, change the tag name to the name given in the corresponding cell in the second column. (This fixes the case of SVG elements that are not all lowercase.)"
				}
				table {
					thead {
						tr {
							th " Tag name "
							th " Element name "
						}
					}
					tbody {
						tr {
							td {
								code altglyph
							}
							td {
								code altGlyph
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code altglyphdef
							}
							td {
								code altGlyphDef
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code altglyphitem
							}
							td {
								code altGlyphItem
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code animatecolor
							}
							td {
								code animateColor
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code animatemotion
							}
							td {
								code animateMotion
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code animatetransform
							}
							td {
								code animateTransform
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code clippath
							}
							td {
								code clipPath
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feblend
							}
							td {
								code feBlend
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fecolormatrix
							}
							td {
								code feColorMatrix
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fecomponenttransfer
							}
							td {
								code feComponentTransfer
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fecomposite
							}
							td {
								code feComposite
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feconvolvematrix
							}
							td {
								code feConvolveMatrix
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fediffuselighting
							}
							td {
								code feDiffuseLighting
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fedisplacementmap
							}
							td {
								code feDisplacementMap
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fedistantlight
							}
							td {
								code feDistantLight
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fedropshadow
							}
							td {
								code feDropShadow
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feflood
							}
							td {
								code feFlood
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fefunca
							}
							td {
								code feFuncA
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fefuncb
							}
							td {
								code feFuncB
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fefuncg
							}
							td {
								code feFuncG
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fefuncr
							}
							td {
								code feFuncR
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fegaussianblur
							}
							td {
								code feGaussianBlur
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feimage
							}
							td {
								code feImage
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code femerge
							}
							td {
								code feMerge
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code femergenode
							}
							td {
								code feMergeNode
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code femorphology
							}
							td {
								code feMorphology
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feoffset
							}
							td {
								code feOffset
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fepointlight
							}
							td {
								code fePointLight
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fespecularlighting
							}
							td {
								code feSpecularLighting
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fespotlight
							}
							td {
								code feSpotLight
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code fetile
							}
							td {
								code feTile
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code feturbulence
							}
							td {
								code feTurbulence
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code foreignobject
							}
							td {
								code foreignObject
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code glyphref
							}
							td {
								code glyphRef
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code lineargradient
							}
							td {
								code linearGradient
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code radialgradient
							}
							td {
								code radialGradient
							}
						}
						tr {
							td {
								code textpath
							}
							td {
								code textPath
							}
						}
					}
				}
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#adjusted-current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjusted-current-node-3 "adjusted current node"
					- " is an element in the "
					a data-x-internal=svg-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#svg-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:svg-namespace-2 "SVG namespace"
					- ", "
					a href="#adjust-svg-attributes" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjust-svg-attributes "adjust SVG attributes"
					- " for the token. (This fixes the case of SVG attributes that are not all lowercase.)"
				}
				p {
					a href="#adjust-foreign-attributes" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjust-foreign-attributes "Adjust foreign attributes"
					- " for the token. (This fixes the use of namespaced attributes, in particular XLink in SVG.)"
				}
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-foreign-element" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insert-a-foreign-element "Insert a foreign element"
					- " for the token, with "
					a href="#adjusted-current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:adjusted-current-node-4 "adjusted current node"
					- "'s namespace and false."
				}
				p {
					- "If the token has its "
					i id=parsing-main-inforeign:self-closing-flag {
						a href="#self-closing-flag" "self-closing flag"
					}
					- " set, then run the appropriate steps from the following list:"
				}
				dl class=switch {
					dt {
						- "If the token's tag name is \"script\", and the new "
						a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node-2 "current node"
						- " is in the "
						a data-x-internal=svg-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#svg-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:svg-namespace-3 "SVG namespace"
					}
					dd {
						p {
							a href="#acknowledge-self-closing-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:acknowledge-self-closing-flag {
								- "Acknowledge the token's "
								i "self-closing flag"
							}
							- ", and then act as described in the steps for a \"script\" end tag below."
						}
					}
					dt Otherwise
					dd {
						p {
							- "Pop the "
							a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node-3 "current node"
							- " off the "
							a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements-2 "stack of open elements"
							- " and "
							a href="#acknowledge-self-closing-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:acknowledge-self-closing-flag-2 {
								- "acknowledge the token's "
								i "self-closing flag"
							}
							- .
						}
					}
				}
			}
			dt id=scriptForeignEndTag {
				- "An end tag whose tag name is \"script\", if the "
				a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node-4 "current node"
				- " is an "
				a data-x-internal=svg-script href="https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/interact.html#ScriptElement" id=parsing-main-inforeign:svg-script {
					- "SVG "
					code script
				}
				- " element"
			}
			dd {
				p {
					- "Pop the "
					a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node-5 "current node"
					- " off the "
					a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements-3 "stack of open elements"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "Let the "
					var "old insertion point"
					- " have the same value as the current "
					a href="#insertion-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-point "insertion point"
					- ". Let the "
					a href="#insertion-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-point-2 "insertion point"
					- " be just before the "
					a href="#next-input-character" id=parsing-main-inforeign:next-input-character "next input character"
					- .
				}
				p {
					- "Increment the parser's "
					a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-inforeign:script-nesting-level "script nesting level"
					- " by one. Set the "
					a href="#parser-pause-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parser-pause-flag "parser pause flag"
					- " to true."
				}
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#active-speculative-html-parser" id=parsing-main-inforeign:active-speculative-html-parser "active speculative HTML parser"
					- " is null and the user agent supports SVG, then "
					a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/SVGMobile12/script.html#ScriptContentProcessing" {
						- "Process the SVG "
						code script
						- " element"
					}
					- " according to the SVG rules. "
					a href="#refsSVG" "[SVG]"
				}
				p class=note {
					- "Even if this causes "
					a href="#dom-document-write" id=parsing-main-inforeign:dom-document-write "new characters to be inserted into the tokenizer"
					- ", the parser will not be executed reentrantly, since the "
					a href="#parser-pause-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parser-pause-flag-2 "parser pause flag"
					- " is true."
				}
				p {
					- "Decrement the parser's "
					a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-inforeign:script-nesting-level-2 "script nesting level"
					- " by one. If the parser's "
					a href="#script-nesting-level" id=parsing-main-inforeign:script-nesting-level-3 "script nesting level"
					- " is zero, then set the "
					a href="#parser-pause-flag" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parser-pause-flag-3 "parser pause flag"
					- " to false."
				}
				p {
					- "Let the "
					a href="#insertion-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-point-3 "insertion point"
					- " have the value of the "
					var "old insertion point"
					- ". (In other words, restore the "
					a href="#insertion-point" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-point-4 "insertion point"
					- " to its previous value. This value might be the \"undefined\" value.)"
				}
			}
			dt "Any other end tag"
			dd {
				p "Run these steps:"
				ol {
					li {
						p {
							- "Initialize "
							var node
							- " to be the "
							a href="#current-node" id=parsing-main-inforeign:current-node-6 "current node"
							- " (the bottommost node of the stack)."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If "
							var node
							- "'s tag name, "
							a data-x-internal=converted-to-ascii-lowercase href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=parsing-main-inforeign:converted-to-ascii-lowercase "converted to ASCII lowercase"
							- ", is not the same as the tag name of the token, then this is a "
							a href="#parse-errors" id=parsing-main-inforeign:parse-errors-4 "parse error"
							- .
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							i Loop
							- ": If "
							var node
							- " is the topmost element in the "
							a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements-4 "stack of open elements"
							- ", then return. ("
							a href="#fragment-case" id=parsing-main-inforeign:fragment-case "fragment case"
							- ")"
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If "
							var node
							- "'s tag name, "
							a data-x-internal=converted-to-ascii-lowercase href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-lowercase" id=parsing-main-inforeign:converted-to-ascii-lowercase-2 "converted to ASCII lowercase"
							- ", is the same as the tag name of the token, pop elements from the "
							a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements-5 "stack of open elements"
							- " until "
							var node
							- " has been popped from the stack, and then return."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "Set "
							var node
							- " to the previous entry in the "
							a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id=parsing-main-inforeign:stack-of-open-elements-6 "stack of open elements"
							- .
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If "
							var node
							- " is not an element in the "
							a data-x-internal=html-namespace-2 href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=parsing-main-inforeign:html-namespace-2-2 "HTML namespace"
							- ", return to the step labeled "
							i loop
							- .
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "Otherwise, process the token according to the rules given in the section corresponding to the current "
							a href="#insertion-mode" id=parsing-main-inforeign:insertion-mode-2 "insertion mode"
							- " in HTML content."
						}
					}
				}
			}
		}
		h4 id=the-end {
			span class=secno "13.2.7"
			- " The end"
			a class=self-link href="#the-end"
		}
		div class="mdn-anno wrapped before" {
			button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick="toggleStatus(this)" {
				b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines." ✔
				span MDN
			}
			div class=feature {
				p {
					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document/DOMContentLoaded_event" title="The DOMContentLoaded event fires when the initial HTML document has been completely loaded and parsed, without waiting for stylesheets, images, and subframes to finish loading." "Document/DOMContentLoaded_event"
				}
				p class=all-engines-text "Support in all current engines."
				div class=support {
					span class="firefox yes" {
						span Firefox
						span "1+"
					}
					span class="safari yes" {
						span Safari
						span "3.1+"
					}
					span class="chrome yes" {
						span Chrome
						span "1+"
					}
					hr
					span class="opera yes" {
						span Opera
						span "9+"
					}
					span class="edge_blink yes" {
						span Edge
