		p {
			- "Note how the second "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-p-element-5 {
				a href="#the-p-element" p
			}
			- " element in the markup has no explicit "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-b-element-21 {
				a href="#the-b-element" b
			}
			- " elements, but in the resulting DOM, up to three of each kind of formatting element (in this case three "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-b-element-22 {
				a href="#the-b-element" b
			}
			- " elements with the class attribute, and two unadorned "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-b-element-23 {
				a href="#the-b-element" b
			}
			- " elements) get reconstructed before the element's \"X\"."
		}
		p {
			- "Also note how this means that in the final paragraph only six "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-b-element-24 {
				a href="#the-b-element" b
			}
			- " end tags are needed to completely clear the "
			a href="#list-of-active-formatting-elements" id=unclosed-formatting-elements:list-of-active-formatting-elements "list of active formatting elements"
			- ", even though nine "
			code id=unclosed-formatting-elements:the-b-element-25 {
				a href="#the-b-element" b
			}
			- " start tags have been seen up to this point."
		}
		h3 id=serialising-html-fragments {
			span class=secno "13.3"
			- " Serializing HTML fragments"
			a class=self-link href="#serialising-html-fragments"
		}
		p {
			- "For the purposes of the following algorithm, an element "
			dfn id=serializes-as-void "serializes as void"
			- " if its element type is one of the "
			a href="#void-elements" id=serialising-html-fragments:void-elements "void elements"
			- ", or is "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:basefont {
				a href="#basefont" basefont
			}
			- ", "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:bgsound {
				a href="#bgsound" bgsound
			}
			- ", "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:frame {
				a href="#frame" frame
			}
			- ", "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:keygen {
				a href="#keygen" keygen
			}
			- ", or "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:param {
				a href="#param" param
			}
			- .
		}
		p {
			- "The following steps form the "
			dfn data-export="" id=html-fragment-serialisation-algorithm "HTML fragment serialization algorithm"
			- ". The algorithm takes as input a DOM "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:element {
				a data-x-internal=element href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-element" Element
			}
			- ", "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:document {
				a href="#document" Document
			}
			- ", or "
			code id=serialising-html-fragments:documentfragment {
				a data-x-internal=documentfragment href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-documentfragment" DocumentFragment
			}
			- " referred to as "
			var "the node"
			- ", a boolean "
			var serializableShadowRoots
			- ", and a "
			code sequence<ShadowRoot>
			var shadowRoots
			- ", and returns a string."
		}
		p class=note {
			- "This algorithm serializes the "
			em children
			- " of the node being serialized, not the node itself."
		}
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var "the node"
					a href="#serializes-as-void" id=serialising-html-fragments:serializes-as-void "serializes as void"
					- ", then return the empty string."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var s
					- " be a string, and initialize it to the empty string."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var "the node"
					- " is a "
					code id=serialising-html-fragments:the-template-element {
						a href="#the-template-element" template
					}
					- " element, then let "
					var "the node"
					- " instead be the "
					code id=serialising-html-fragments:the-template-element-2 {
						a href="#the-template-element" template
					}
					- " element's "
					a href="#template-contents" id=serialising-html-fragments:template-contents "template contents"
					- " (a "
					code id=serialising-html-fragments:documentfragment-2 {
						a data-x-internal=documentfragment href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-documentfragment" DocumentFragment
					}
					- " node)."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var "current node"
					- " is a "
					a data-x-internal=shadow-host href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#element-shadow-host" id=serialising-html-fragments:shadow-host "shadow host"
					- ", then:"
				}
				ol {
					li {
						p {
							- "Let "
							var shadow
							- " be "
							var "current node"
							- "'s "
							a data-x-internal=concept-element-shadow-root href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-shadow-root" id=serialising-html-fragments:concept-element-shadow-root "shadow root"
							- .
						}
					}
					li {
						p "If one of the following is true:"
						ul {
							li {
								p {
									var serializableShadowRoots
									- " is true and "
									var shadow
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=shadow-serializable href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-serializable" id=serialising-html-fragments:shadow-serializable serializable
									- " is true; or"
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									var shadowRoots
									- " contains "
									var shadow
									- ,
								}
							}
						}
						p then:
						ol {
							li {
								p {
									- "Append \""
									code "<template shadowrootmode=\""
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "If "
									var shadow
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=concept-shadow-root-mode href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-mode" id=serialising-html-fragments:concept-shadow-root-mode mode
									- " is \""
									code open
									- "\", then append \""
									code open
									- "\". Otherwise, append \""
									code closed
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Append \""
									code "\""
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "If "
									var shadow
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=delegates-focus href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-delegates-focus" id=serialising-html-fragments:delegates-focus "delegates focus"
									- " is set, then append \""
									code " shadowrootdelegatesfocus=\"\""
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "If "
									var shadow
									- "'s "
									a href="#serializable" id=serialising-html-fragments:serializable serializable
									- " is set, then append \""
									code " shadowrootserializable=\"\""
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "If "
									var shadow
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=clonable href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#shadowroot-clonable" id=serialising-html-fragments:clonable clonable
									- " is set, then append \""
									code " shadowrootclonable=\"\""
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Append \""
									code >
									- "\"."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Append the value of running the "
									a href="#html-fragment-serialisation-algorithm" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-fragment-serialisation-algorithm "HTML fragment serialization algorithm"
									- " with "
									var shadow
									- ", "
									var serializableShadowRoots
									- ", and "
									var shadowRoots
									- " (thus recursing into this algorithm for that element)."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									- "Append \""
									code "</template>"
									- "\"."
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "For each child node of "
					var "the node"
					- ", in "
					a data-x-internal=tree-order href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order" id=serialising-html-fragments:tree-order "tree order"
					- ", run the following steps:"
				}
				ol {
					li {
						p {
							- "Let "
							var "current node"
							- " be the child node being processed."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "Append the appropriate string from the following list to "
							var s
							- :
						}
						dl class=switch {
							dt {
								- "If "
								var "current node"
								- " is an "
								code id=serialising-html-fragments:element-2 {
									a data-x-internal=element href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-element" Element
								}
							}
							dd {
								p {
									- "If "
									var "current node"
									- " is an element in the "
									a data-x-internal=html-namespace-2 href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-namespace-2 "HTML namespace"
									- ", the "
									a data-x-internal=mathml-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#mathml-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:mathml-namespace "MathML namespace"
									- ", or the "
									a data-x-internal=svg-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#svg-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:svg-namespace "SVG namespace"
									- ", then let "
									var tagname
									- " be "
									var "current node"
									- "'s local name. Otherwise, let "
									var tagname
									- " be "
									var "current node"
									- "'s qualified name."
								}
								p {
									- "Append a U+003C LESS-THAN SIGN character (<), followed by "
									var tagname
									- .
								}
								p class=note {
									- "For "
									a href="#html-elements" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-elements "HTML elements"
									- " created by the "
									a href="#html-parser" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-parser "HTML parser"
									- " or "
									code id=serialising-html-fragments:dom-document-createelement {
										a data-x-internal=dom-document-createelement href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-createelement" "createElement()"
									}
									- ", "
									var tagname
									- " will be lowercase."
								}
								p {
									- "If "
									var "current node"
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=concept-element-is-value href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-is-value" id=serialising-html-fragments:concept-element-is-value {
										code is
										- " value"
									}
									- " is not null, and the element does not have an "
									code id=serialising-html-fragments:attr-is {
										a href="#attr-is" is
									}
									- " attribute in its attribute list, then append the string \""
									code " is=\""
									- "\", followed by "
									var "current node"
									- "'s "
									a data-x-internal=concept-element-is-value href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-element-is-value" id=serialising-html-fragments:concept-element-is-value-2 {
										code is
										- " value"
									}
									a href="#escapingString" id=serialising-html-fragments:escapingString "escaped as described below"
									- " in "
									i "attribute mode"
									- ", followed by a U+0022 QUOTATION MARK character (\")."
								}
								p {
									- "For each attribute that the element has, append a U+0020 SPACE character, the "
									a href="#attribute's-serialised-name" id=serialising-html-fragments:attribute's-serialised-name "attribute's serialized name as described below"
									- ", a U+003D EQUALS SIGN character (=), a U+0022 QUOTATION MARK character (\"), the attribute's value, "
									a href="#escapingString" id=serialising-html-fragments:escapingString-2 "escaped as described below"
									- " in "
									i "attribute mode"
									- ", and a second U+0022 QUOTATION MARK character (\")."
								}
								p {
									- "An "
									dfn id=attribute's-serialised-name "attribute's serialized name"
									- " for the purposes of the previous paragraph must be determined as follows:"
								}
								dl class=switch {
									dt "If the attribute has no namespace"
									dd {
										p "The attribute's serialized name is the attribute's local name."
										p class=note {
											- "For attributes on "
											a href="#html-elements" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-elements-2 "HTML elements"
											- " set by the "
											a href="#html-parser" id=serialising-html-fragments:html-parser-2 "HTML parser"
											- " or by "
											code id=serialising-html-fragments:dom-element-setattribute {
												a data-x-internal=dom-element-setattribute href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-element-setattribute" "setAttribute()"
											}
											- ", the local name will be lowercase."
										}
									}
									dt {
										- "If the attribute is in the "
										a data-x-internal=xml-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xml-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:xml-namespace "XML namespace"
									}
									dd {
										p {
											- "The attribute's serialized name is the string \""
											code xml:
											- "\" followed by the attribute's local name."
										}
									}
									dt {
										- "If the attribute is in the "
										a data-x-internal=xmlns-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:xmlns-namespace "XMLNS namespace"
										- " and the attribute's local name is "
										code xmlns
									}
									dd {
										p {
											- "The attribute's serialized name is the string \""
											code xmlns
											- "\"."
										}
									}
									dt {
										- "If the attribute is in the "
										a data-x-internal=xmlns-namespace href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#xmlns-namespace" id=serialising-html-fragments:xmlns-namespace-2 "XMLNS namespace"
										- " and the attribute's local name is not "
										code xmlns
									}
									dd {
